0 亿美元收购交易，此前北京要求该交易必须反转。目前收购解除程序已启动。","reportEdition":"2026-06-15","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmqe0t4ci01r7slrd7j98j1za","title":"白宫AI监管决定被指偏袒OpenAI与亚马逊","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-06-15T00:00:00.725Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmqe0t4ci01r7slrd7j98j1za","https://garymarcus.substack.com/p/what-washington-must-do"],"articles":[{"id":"cmqe0t4ci01r7slrd7j98j1za","title":"白宫AI监管决定被指偏袒OpenAI与亚马逊","originalTitle":"","summary":"白宫周五做出的AI监管决定被指偏袒OpenAI、亚马逊等企业，同时对Anthropic施压不足24小时，缺乏透明度和事实依据。Gary Marcus、Dean W Ball及卡托研究所Kevin Frazier等专家指出，这种由少数人闭门快速决策的做法带有腐败嫌疑，可能促使其他国家加速发展“主权AI”甚至中国AI，并导致美国人才流失。Anthropic声明称政府应在法定程序中基于技术事实阻止不安全部署，而非当前方式。Marcus呼吁建立独立机构负责AI监管，确保公平、清晰、基于证据的执行。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmqe0t4ci01r7slrd7j98j1za","originalUrl":"https://garymarcus.substack.com/p/what-washington-must-do","publishedAt":"2026-06-15T00:00:00.725Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1b4wzwz","originalSourceName":"Gary Marcus：The Road to AI We Can Trust（RSS）","family":"outlet-a0gkqk","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmqe0t4ci01r7slrd7j98j1za","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-07T04:49:10.918Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1b4wzwz","name":"Gary Marcus：The Road to AI We Can Trust（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-07T04:49:10.918Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"白宫周五做出的AI监管决定被指偏袒OpenAI、亚马逊等企业，同时对Anthropic施压不足24小时，缺乏透明度和事实依据。Gary Marcus、Dean W Ball及卡托研究所Kevin Frazier等专家指出，这种由少数人闭门快速决策的做法带有腐败嫌疑，可能促使其他国家加速发展“主权AI”甚至中国AI，并导致美国人才流失。Anthropic声明称政府应在法定程序中基于技术事实阻止不安全部署，而非当前方式。Marcus呼吁建立独立机构负责AI监管，确保公平、清晰、基于证据的执行。","reportEdition":"2026-06-15","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmqdyt4ro019jslrde6w3jkxh","title":"Satya Nadella：没有生态的前沿不稳定","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-06-15T00:00:00.725Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmqdyt4ro019jslrde6w3jkxh","https://x.com/satyanadella/status/2066182223213293753"],"articles":[{"id":"cmqdyt4ro019jslrde6w3jkxh","title":"Satya Nadella：没有生态的前沿不稳定","originalTitle":"","summary":"微软CEO Satya Nadella认为，AI驱动的平台转变首次实现人与数字系统间的认知循环。企业需同时构建人力资本（知识、判断、关系）与token资本（自有的AI能力），且人力资本不会贬值，反而随token资本增长而增值。真正的机会在于建立人力资本与token资本复合增长的学习循环——企业应能替换通用模型而不丢失已内化的专家知识，通过私有评估和强化学习让模型从内部真实轨迹中持续提升。他警告，若所有价值被少数模型吞噬，将重演全球化空心化悲剧，呼吁构建前沿生态系统，让每家企业、行业和国家拥有自己的学习循环。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmqdyt4ro019jslrde6w3jkxh","originalUrl":"https://x.com/satyanadella/status/2066182223213293753","publishedAt":"2026-06-15T00:00:00.725Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-x43g6j","originalSourceName":"X：Satya Nadella (@satyanadella)","family":"outlet-mgysik","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmqdyt4ro019jslrde6w3jkxh","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-07T04:49:10.918Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-x43g6j","name":"X：Satya Nadella (@satyanadella)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-07T04:49:10.918Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"微软CEO Satya Nadella认为，AI驱动的平台转变首次实现人与数字系统间的认知循环。企业需同时构建人力资本（知识、判断、关系）与token资本（自有的AI能力），且人力资本不会贬值，反而随token资本增长而增值。真正的机会在于建立人力资本与token资本复合增长的学习循环——企业应能替换通用模型而不丢失已内化的专家知识，通过私有评估和强化学习让模型从内部真实轨迹中持续提升。他警告，若所有价值被少数模型吞噬，将重演全球化空心化悲剧，呼吁构建前沿生态系统，让每家企业、行业和国家拥有自己的学习循环。","reportEdition":"2026-06-15","reportKind":"daily"}],"total":4,"partial":false,"itemSourceCount":3,"topics":[{"topic":"行业","count":2},{"topic":"开发","count":2}],"method":"AIHOT 提供选题、摘要与编排；模境保留来源与报告窗口，关联模型数据。原报道与模型评测分别核对，不将资讯排名当作能力评分。"}}
